    {
      "id": "cb9cfaa796aa78dfa1d0bccbdc2efd0134a333ef",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 428433477,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Thanks for improving the stun dissector! This particular patch adds a problem by adding the line 'att_type ^= 1;'.\nIf you look at the output, the numeric value is now incorrectly shown inverted as well (that's why I introduced the att_type_display variable in the first place).\nPlease send a follow up patch to fix this.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7354663,
            "username": "jmayer2",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Jörg Mayer",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/169640aaef0383905a7367726222ac4b97063ae8ad4d0f72aa58ebfe89c33a5d?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/jmayer2"
          },
          "created_at": "2020-10-12T21:29:09.548Z",
          "updated_at": "2020-10-13T11:32:07.960Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 71108558,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 317,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 428781901,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "You are right: with my change the numeric value is incorrect (and it doesn't match the bytes in the packet bytes panel), but the string of the hf_stun_att_type field is correct. If I revert my change, the number is fine, but the string is not...\n\nI think the best solution should be to have the \"right\" string and the number as in the packet, but I have no idea how to achieve that... What do you think?\n\nExample: stun_ms.pcapng, packet 2, 5th attribute: \"stun_attribute\" is correctly set to \"NONCE\", but \"stun.att.type\" should be \"NONCE (0x0014)\", IMO",
          "author": {
            "id": 6875072,
            "username": "IvanNardi",
